# Shared third-party dependencies of the server image, with the same
# lower bounds the distributions declare (see requirements.txt and
# packages/*/pyproject.toml). torch/torchvision are pinned per target
# in server.cpu.in / server.cu132.in, because the torch indexes ship
# them with a +cpu/+cu132 local version segment.
#
# This file is the input to the hashed lockfiles — edit the bounds
# here, then recompile both targets (see server.cpu.in).
